  "abstract": "Deterministic non-local ablation: apply tiny global affine transforms (anisotropic scale, shear, small rotation about (0.5,0.5)) to the best stored centers; for each warped candidate, solve exact zero\u2011slack radii LP and apply an iterative zero\u2011tolerance finalize. Accept only if sum(r) improves by >1e\u20119. Logs full\u2011precision scores and persists the best. Probes whether global deformations can create feasible radius gains near SOTA.",
